        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ecb793bd-1a30-53c7-bcb5-8e47bfba2217",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nugroho Notosusanto\n- Events: Indonesian National Revolution, Indonesian War of Independence\n- Organizations: Student Army\n- Places: Indonesia\n- Topics: armed conflict, diplomatic struggle, social revolution, postwar and postcolonial transition\n\nFacts:\n- The Indonesian National Revolution took place from 1945 to 1949.\n- The Indonesian National Revolution was also called the Indonesian War of Independence.\n- The Indonesian National Revolution was an armed conflict and diplomatic struggle between the Republic of Indonesia and the Dutch Empire.\n- The Indonesian National Revolution also involved an internal social revolution in postwar and postcolonial Indonesia.\n- During the Indonesian National Revolution from 1945 to 1949, Nugroho Notosusanto served actively in the Student Army in a reconnaissance role.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
